{
  "openapi": "3.0.4",
  "info": {
    "title": "FluentCart API",
    "description": "Complete REST API documentation for FluentCart e-commerce platform",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://{website}/wp-json/fluent-cart/v2",
      "description": "Your WordPress website",
      "variables": {
        "website": {
          "default": "YourWebsite.com",
          "description": "Your WordPress website domain (without https://)"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "ApplicationPasswords": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/orders": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "createOrder",
        "summary": "POST Create Order",
        "description": "Create a new order manually from the admin panel.\n\n**Required permission:** `orders/create`\n\n### How the order is priced\n\nThe server prices the order itself. Which rules apply depends on what you send:\n\n| You send | Pricing |\n|---|---|\n| `quote_revision` from [Price Order](./price-order) | Priced again exactly like the preview. If the revision or `total_amount` no longer matches, the call fails with `fx_prices_updated` and nothing is saved. |\n| A `currency` other than the store currency, no `quote_revision` | Priced on the server in that currency. Catalog lines take the product's price converted at the rate. Every posted catalog `unit_price`, and `total_amount` when it is not 0, must match the server's value or the call fails with `fx_prices_updated`. |\n| Store currency, or no `currency` | Posted line prices are used as sent. Coupons and the manual discount are checked and applied on top. |\n\nAll amounts are in cents of the **order's currency**. Coupons are always validated on the server (active, dates, usage limits, per-customer limits, minimum purchase).\n\n### Currency and rate\n\n1. No `currency`, or the store currency: priced from the posted prices. `rate` is ignored.\n2. A foreign currency while Multi-Currency is off: refused with `invalid_currency`. No order is created.\n3. A foreign currency that is not enabled in Multi-Currency settings, or has no exchange rate: refused with `invalid_currency`, even when `rate` is sent.\n4. An enabled foreign currency without `rate`: the store's rate is used, with its margin and rounding.\n5. An enabled foreign currency with `rate`: that rate is used exactly as sent (no margin, rounding, charm pricing or adjustment). It must be a number above 0 with at most 12 integer digits, or the call fails with `invalid_amount`.\n6. `quote_revision` sent: `rate` is ignored and the order must still match the preview, or the call fails with `fx_prices_updated`.\n\nIn cases 4 and 5, every posted catalog `unit_price`, and `total_amount` when it is not 0, must match the server's value, or the call fails with `fx_prices_updated`. Item-level `rate` is always ignored.\n\nUse [List Order Currencies](./list-order-currencies) to find which currencies can be used.",
        "tags": [
          "Orders"
        ],
        "security": [
          {
            "ApplicationPasswords": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "customer_id",
                  "order_items"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "customer_id": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "description": "ID of the customer placing the order"
                  },
                  "order_items": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "description": "Array of order items",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "id": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "description": "Order item ID (for updates)"
                        },
                        "order_id": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "description": "Parent order ID"
                        },
                        "post_id": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "description": "WordPress post ID of the product"
                        },
                        "variation_id": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "description": "Product variation ID"
                        },
                        "object_id": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "description": "Object reference ID"
                        },
                        "fulfillment_type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "`digital` or `physical`"
                        },
                        "payment_type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "Payment type (max 100 chars), e.g., `subscription`"
                        },
                        "quantity": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "description": "Item quantity (min: 1)",
                          "minimum": 1
                        },
                        "post_title": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "Product title (max 255 chars)"
                        },
                        "title": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "Item title (max 255 chars)"
                        },
                        "price": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "description": "Item price in cents. Recomputed by the server."
                        },
                        "unit_price": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "description": "Unit price in cents of the order's currency. For a catalog line in a foreign currency it must match the server's converted price, unless `has_custom_price` is true."
                        },
                        "has_custom_price": {
                          "type": "boolean",
                          "description": "`true` when the admin typed this price. The server then keeps `unit_price` as sent (in the order's currency, zero or more, whole units for zero-decimal currencies) instead of the catalog price."
                        },
                        "shipping_charge": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "description": "Shipping charge in cents"
                        },
                        "item_cost": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "description": "Item cost in cents"
                        },
                        "item_total": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "description": "Item total in cents"
                        },
                        "tax_amount": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "description": "Tax amount in cents"
                        },
                        "discount_total": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "description": "Discount total in cents"
                        },
                        "total": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "description": "Total in cents"
                        },
                        "line_total": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "description": "Line total in cents"
                        },
                        "cart_index": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "description": "Cart position index"
                        },
                        "rate": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "description": "Ignored. The order-level `rate` applies."
                        },
                        "line_meta": {
                          "type": "array",
                          "description": "Line item metadata",
                          "items": {
                            "type": "object"
                          }
                        },
                        "other_info": {
                          "type": "object",
                          "description": "Additional item information"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "status": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Order status (max 50 chars)"
                  },
                  "invoice_no": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Invoice number (max 100 chars)"
                  },
                  "fulfillment_type": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Fulfillment type (max 50 chars)"
                  },
                  "type": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Order type (max 50 chars)"
                  },
                  "payment_method": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Payment method key (max 50 chars)"
                  },
                  "payment_method_title": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Payment method display title (max 50 chars)"
                  },
                  "payment_status": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Payment status (max 50 chars)"
                  },
                  "currency": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Order currency code, e.g. `EUR` (max 10 chars). Must be the store currency or an enabled Multi-Currency currency with a rate. Defaults to the store currency."
                  },
                  "subtotal": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Order subtotal in cents"
                  },
                  "discount_tax": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Discount tax amount in cents"
                  },
                  "manual_discount_total": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Manual discount total in cents"
                  },
                  "coupon_discount_total": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Coupon discount total in cents"
                  },
                  "shipping_tax": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Shipping tax in cents"
                  },
                  "shipping_total": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Shipping total in cents of the order's currency (zero or more, whole units for zero-decimal currencies). If items carry `shipping_charge`, those must add up to this value."
                  },
                  "tax_total": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Tax total in cents"
                  },
                  "total_amount": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Order total in cents, before tax. With `quote_revision`, it must equal the preview's `total_amount`. For a foreign currency without `quote_revision`, a non-zero value must equal the server's total; send 0 or omit it to skip the check."
                  },
                  "rate": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Exchange rate from the store currency to `currency`. Optional; overrides the store's rate for a foreign currency and is stored exactly as sent. Must be above 0 with at most 12 integer digits. Ignored for the store currency and when `quote_revision` is sent."
                  },
                  "quote_revision": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Revision returned by [Price Order](./price-order) (max 32 chars). When sent, the order is priced like that preview and must still match it, or the call fails with `fx_prices_updated`."
                  },
                  "note": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Order note (max 5000 chars)"
                  },
                  "uuid": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Order UUID (max 100 chars)"
                  },
                  "ip_address": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Customer IP address (max 100 chars)"
                  },
                  "completed_at": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Completion timestamp (max 100 chars)"
                  },
                  "refunded_at": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Refund timestamp (max 100 chars)"
                  },
                  "user_tz": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "User timezone (max 50 chars)"
                  },
                  "discount": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "description": "Manual discount. Only `value` (in the order's currency, not cents) is used for the amount; it cannot exceed the order subtotal.",
                    "properties": {
                      "type": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Ignored. The value is always a fixed amount."
                      },
                      "value": {
                        "type": "number",
                        "description": "Discount amount in the order's currency, e.g. `5` for 5.00."
                      },
                      "label": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Discount label (max 100 chars)"
                      },
                      "reason": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Discount reason (max 100 chars)"
                      },
                      "action": {
                        "type": "string",
                        "description": "Discount action (max 100 chars)"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "shipping": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "description": "Shipping method details, stored as order meta for display. The charged amount comes from `shipping_total`.",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "type": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "Shipping type (max 100 chars)"
                        },
                        "rate_name": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "Shipping rate name (max 100 chars)"
                        },
                        "custom_price": {
                          "type": "number",
                          "description": "Custom shipping price in cents"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "applied_coupon": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "description": "Coupons to apply, keyed by coupon code, e.g. `{\"SAVE10\": {\"id\": 3}}`. Only the codes are read: discounts are recalculated on the server. On this endpoint each entry must include the coupon `id`.",
                    "additionalProperties": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "id": {
                          "type": "integer",
                          "description": "Coupon ID"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "trigger": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Trigger source"
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "customer_id": 1,
                  "order_items": [
                    {
                      "post_id": 10,
                      "variation_id": 5,
                      "object_id": 5,
                      "quantity": 1,
                      "unit_price": 2500,
                      "price": 2500,
                      "item_total": 2500,
                      "total": 2500,
                      "line_total": 2500,
                      "title": "Pro License"
                    }
                  ],
                  "subtotal": 2500,
                  "total_amount": 2500,
                  "payment_method": "offline_payment"
                }
              },
              "example": {
                "customer_id": 1,
                "order_items": [
                  {
                    "post_id": 10,
                    "variation_id": 5,
                    "object_id": 5,
                    "quantity": 1,
                    "unit_price": 2500,
                    "price": 2500,
                    "item_total": 2500,
                    "total": 2500,
                    "line_total": 2500,
                    "title": "Pro License"
                  }
                ],
                "subtotal": 2500,
                "total_amount": 2500,
                "payment_method": "offline_payment"
              },
              "examples": {
                "default": {
                  "summary": "Example request",
                  "value": {
                    "customer_id": 1,
                    "order_items": [
                      {
                        "post_id": 10,
                        "variation_id": 5,
                        "object_id": 5,
                        "quantity": 1,
                        "unit_price": 2500,
                        "price": 2500,
                        "item_total": 2500,
                        "total": 2500,
                        "line_total": 2500,
                        "title": "Pro License"
                      }
                    ],
                    "subtotal": 2500,
                    "total_amount": 2500,
                    "payment_method": "offline_payment"
                  }
                },
                "foreign_currency": {
                  "summary": "Order in EUR at a fixed rate",
                  "value": {
                    "customer_id": 1,
                    "currency": "EUR",
                    "rate": "0.92",
                    "order_items": [
                      {
                        "post_id": 10,
                        "variation_id": 5,
                        "object_id": 5,
                        "quantity": 1,
                        "unit_price": 2300
                      }
                    ],
                    "total_amount": 2300
                  }
                },
                "previewed": {
                  "summary": "Save after Price Order",
                  "value": {
                    "customer_id": 1,
                    "currency": "EUR",
                    "quote_revision": "afe0d9020e760936a57bea648532cb53",
                    "order_items": [
                      {
                        "post_id": 10,
                        "variation_id": 5,
                        "object_id": 5,
                        "quantity": 1,
                        "unit_price": 2300
                      }
                    ],
                    "applied_coupon": {
                      "SAVE10": {
                        "id": 3
                      }
                    },
                    "total_amount": 2070
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Order created successfully.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "message": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "Success message"
                    },
                    "order_id": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "description": "Created order ID"
                    },
                    "uuid": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "Created order UUID"
                    }
                  },
                  "example": {
                    "message": "Order created successfully!",
                    "order_id": 42,
                    "uuid": "abc123-def456-ghi789"
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "message": "Order created successfully!",
                  "order_id": 42,
                  "uuid": "abc123-def456-ghi789"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "default": {
                    "summary": "Successful response",
                    "value": {
                      "message": "Order created successfully!",
                      "order_id": 42,
                      "uuid": "abc123-def456-ghi789"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Not authenticated. The request carried no valid WordPress credentials.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "code": "rest_forbidden",
                  "message": "Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.",
                  "data": {
                    "status": 401
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Authenticated, but the user lacks the required capability (`orders/create`).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "code": "rest_forbidden",
                  "message": "Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.",
                  "data": {
                    "status": 403
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation failed, a price no longer matches, or a currency/amount is not allowed.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "examples": {
                  "validation": {
                    "summary": "Validation failed",
                    "value": {
                      "message": "The given data was invalid.",
                      "errors": {
                        "field_name": [
                          "This field is required."
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "fx_prices_updated": {
                    "summary": "Prices changed since the preview, or a posted price/total does not match",
                    "value": {
                      "code": "fx_prices_updated",
                      "message": "Prices were updated to today's exchange rate. Please review your order total before paying.",
                      "data": {
                        "status": 422
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "invalid_currency": {
                    "summary": "Currency not enabled",
                    "value": {
                      "code": "invalid_currency",
                      "message": "JPY is not an enabled currency with an exchange rate.",
                      "data": {
                        "status": 422
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "invalid_amount": {
                    "summary": "Bad rate or amount",
                    "value": {
                      "code": "invalid_amount",
                      "message": "Rate must be a number above 0.",
                      "data": {
                        "status": 422
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "invalid_product": {
                    "summary": "Product removed",
                    "value": {
                      "code": "invalid_product",
                      "message": "A product on this order no longer exists.",
                      "data": {
                        "status": 422
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {},
    "securitySchemes": {
      "ApplicationPasswords": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "Authorization",
        "description": "WordPress Application Passwords \u2014 use Basic auth with your WordPress username and an application password in the format: username:application_password"
      }
    }
  }
}
